  - [x] Reserve proof that cleanup resource projection accepts only the effect
        receipt and emits bindings to the previously validated plan.
  - [x] Reserve proof that diagnostic projection is bounded plain data.
- [x] Perform a follow-up review before building the runner on these contracts.

